          "caption": "Silver soup tureen and water jug, made by Joseph Balthazar Eymael, Maastricht, 1786-1788. These objects were made to honour Gisbertus van der Vrecken who in 1787 was primus at the University of Louvain. The tureen was presented by the city of Maastricht; the jug by the chapter of Saint Servatius. Tureen: collection Bonnefantenmuseum. Jug: private collection. Both on loan to Museum aan het Vrijthof, Maastricht, Netherlands.",
